# Was centered at Z=0.05 with depth 0.55, leaving only a 0.075m sliver of Body behind it
# (Body's own back face is at Z=-0.325) - thin enough that the back panel was effectively
# missing/invisible in-game. Shifted forward to Z=0.075 (Body depth also grew 0.6->0.65)
# so there's a solid ~0.125m back wall, while the hole still overshoots Body's front face by
# 0.025m (same margin as before) to guarantee a full, non-coplanar cut through the open side.
